Selling & Marketing Exp |      6428.07 |      7120.19 |      6394.39 |      6387.32 |\n| R&D Exp                 |      1114.80 |      1133.64 |      1097.57 |      1100.95 |\n| General & Admin Exp     |      1972.20 |      2385.49 |      1770.12 |      1781.05 |\n| Operating Income        |     13102.60 |     11501.28 |     12098.17 |     12539.88 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |        21.96 |        17.61 |        21.00 |        22.24 |\n| Net Income              |     10109.93 |      9298.54 |      9440.10 |     10167.16 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |        16.94 |        14.23 |        16.39 |        18.03 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |     11103.50 |     31989.27 |     16173.82 |     16331.90 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |    -14529.77 |    -17639.29 |     17425.23 |     -8927.54 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |      1674.71 |      -983.41 |    -45145.10 |     -1269.97 |\n| CAPEX                   |     -4864.65 |     -8965.31 |     -6141.65 |     -6952.75 |"
